At some unknown point, Tersly joined the [[Huntik Foundation]] and became an assistant to [[Montehue]], based at the [[Post Street Museum]]. {{source|The Legacy of Thor}}

Eventually, Tersly was visited by [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert|some of]] [[Sophie Casterwill|his team]], who were searching for information on the Hammer of Thor, [[Mjolnir]]. Tersly told Dante what he knew, and also about his suspicions of Thor being a seeker, before Dante left. Later, Montehue returned to the museum where Tersly worked and managed to get Tersly to tell him about Dante and his team's mission for the hammer of Thor, and the two left to join them. They caught up with them on the Rainbow Bridge in Iceland, where Tersly used [[Venadek]] while Montehue used his axes to help fight off [[Frost Minion]]s. They all then proceeded to enter the Temple of Thor and follow one of the guardians of Thor. {{source|The Legacy of Thor}}

Tersly and [[Montehue]] later joined the team outside [[King Solomon's mines]] where they helped defeat the three colossi, [[Ashtoreth]], [[Milcom]] and [[Chemosh]]. Venturing into the mines to find the [[Legendary Titan]] of Spirit, [[Tao]], Tersly invoked [[Red Searcher]] helped study and translate the instructions to open the vault, dressing [[Lok]] and [[Sophie]] in the garments of [[King Solomon]] and the [[Queen of Sheba]]. When the [[Organization]] arrived, Tersly invoked [[Venadek]] to help the team hold them off and give Lok time to succeed in invoking Tao. {{source|To Be Together}}

After the fall of [[the Professor]], Tersly was seen present as the surprise party at [[Dante Vale's house]] to congratulate the Huntik team on their victory and the recovery of [[Metz]]. {{Source|The Mission}}
[[File:S2E44_Tersly_cat.png|170px|thumb]]
Tersly and Montehue later joined the Huntik team on a mission to recover the [[Ring]] of [[Phoenix]]. After being ambushed by some [[Casterwill Hunters]], Tersly saved [[Den Fears]] from falling into a lava tube. He later invoked Red Searcher to help find the entrance to the labyrinth so they could destroy the [[Lodestone]]. Tersly remained outside the cave to help navigate the team through the maze but was interrupted by a lioness. When the Lodestone was destroyed, Tersly invoked Venadek, scaring off the animal. {{source|The Dead Magic Island}} Tersly later helped Montehue hold off the [[Blood Spiral]] to give the Huntik team time to enter the [[Phoenix Volcano]] and recover Phoenix. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

On the longest night of the year, Tersly traveled with the [[Huntik Foundation]] on the [[Scramjet]]s to the [[Spiral Mark]]. He was saddened to hear of Dante's death but accompanied Montehue onto the battlefield. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}} In the midst of battle, Tersly and Montehue climbed aboard one of the jets that were being bombarded by [[Wind]] and [[Shakrit]]. Tersly managed to stabilize the controls while Montehue and [[Momax]] used [[Mjolnir]] to defeat the enemy Titan. After the defeat of [[the Betrayer]], Tersly was seen celebrating the victory with the other Foundation and [[Casterwill family]] members. {{source|Dante's Return}}

